<title>UK: T&amp;N says sales volumes in line with views.</title>
<headline>T&amp;N says sales volumes in line with views.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>British automotive components and engineering group T&amp;N Plc said on Thursday its sales volumes were in line with expectations, confirming some recovery in its heavy duty and industrial markets.</p>
</text>
